  "description": "Eesuh Yoon appears to have it all: beauty, intelligence, privilege, and a great career. Men are captivated by her, but none can truly capture her heart. Her future seems predestined—settle down with a suitable partner and live a life of luxury. Enter Tae-Joh Ryu, a wealthy and arrogant man determined to “humble her.” However, their passionate encounter leaves Eesuh feeling distant and uninterested while Tae-Joh finds himself falling for the woman he once called a “doormat.”\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes 10 extra chapters.*",
